{"parse":{"title":"Stellar Jubilee Passive","pageid":477878,"revid":2176168,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Stellar Jubilee Passive</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talents\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Passive Talents\">Passive Talents</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Stellar Jubilee Passives</b> are passive <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> available for <a href=\"/wiki/Snezhnaya\" title=\"Snezhnaya\">Snezhnaya</a> characters with <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Linchpin\" title=\"Stellar Linchpin\">Stellar Linchpins</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Traveler_(Cryo)\" title=\"Traveler (Cryo)\">Traveler (Cryo)</a> that enable and enhance <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Glimmer_Reaction\" title=\"Stellar Glimmer Reaction\">Stellar Glimmer Reactions</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stellar_Jubilee_Passive_Talents\">Stellar Jubilee Passive Talents</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStellar_Jubilee_Passive%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nThere are <b>4</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a>&#160;that match the category selection:</p><table class=\"article-table sortable alternating-colors-table tdc1\" data-expandtext=\"+\" data-collapsetext=\"-\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Talent</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"talent\"><span class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"talent-image\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dance_of_Aurore\" title=\"Dance of Aurore\"><img alt=\"Dance of Aurore\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Dance of Aurore.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Dance_of_Aurore.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Dance_of_Aurore.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20260812034023\" /></a></span></span><br /><span class=\"talent-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dance_of_Aurore\" title=\"Dance of Aurore\">Dance of Aurore</a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dance_of_Aurore\" title=\"Dance of Aurore\"><img alt=\"Dance of Aurore\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Dance of Aurore.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Dance_of_Aurore.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c1/Talent_Dance_of_Aurore.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260812034023\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dance_of_Aurore\" title=\"Dance of Aurore\">Dance of Aurore</a></span></span><hr /><small><span class=\"item character\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\"><img alt=\"Odette\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Odette Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Odette_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Odette_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260812035719\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\"><img alt=\"Odette\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Odette Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Odette_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Odette_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260812035719\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a></span></span></small></td><td>Odette will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state when she is inside a <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When Stellar-Conduct is triggered, the surrounding area will transform into a Polestar Field for a short period of time, and when inside a Polestar Field, certain characters will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state, which grants various skill buffs.</span></span></span>, or the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s after a nearby party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction.<br />When a party member triggers a <a href=\"/wiki/Superconduct\" title=\"Superconduct\">Superconduct</a> or Cryo <a href=\"/wiki/Swirl\" title=\"Swirl\">Swirl</a> reaction, it becomes a <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct\">Stellar-Conduct</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl\" title=\"Stellar Swirl\">Stellar Swirl</a> reaction instead, and the Base DMG of said reaction is also increased by 0.7% for every 100 points of Odette's ATK. A maximum increase of 14% can be obtained in this way.</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"talent\"><span class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"talent-image\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illusory_Frostmirror\" title=\"Illusory Frostmirror\"><img alt=\"Illusory Frostmirror\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Illusory Frostmirror.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Illusory_Frostmirror.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/15/Talent_Illusory_Frostmirror.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20260814234943\" /></a></span></span><br /><span class=\"talent-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illusory_Frostmirror\" title=\"Illusory Frostmirror\">Illusory Frostmirror</a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illusory_Frostmirror\" title=\"Illusory Frostmirror\"><img alt=\"Illusory Frostmirror\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Illusory Frostmirror.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Illusory_Frostmirror.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/15/Talent_Illusory_Frostmirror.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260814234943\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Illusory_Frostmirror\" title=\"Illusory Frostmirror\">Illusory Frostmirror</a></span></span><hr /><small><span class=\"item character\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Traveler_(Cryo)\" title=\"Traveler (Cryo)\"><img alt=\"Traveler (Cryo)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Traveler Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Traveler_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Traveler_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20211220013610\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Traveler_(Cryo)\" title=\"Traveler (Cryo)\"><img alt=\"Traveler (Cryo)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Traveler Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Traveler_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Traveler_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20211220013610\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Traveler_(Cryo)\" title=\"Traveler (Cryo)\">Traveler (Cryo)</a></span></span></small></td><td>The Traveler will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state when inside a Polestar Field, or the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s after a nearby party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction.<br />When a party member triggers a Superconduct or Cryo Swirl reaction, it becomes a Stellar-Conduct or Stellar Swirl reaction instead, and the Base DMG of said reaction is also increased by 0.35% for every 100 points of the Traveler's ATK. A maximum 7% increase can be obtained in this way.</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"talent\"><span class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"talent-image\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\"><img alt=\"Light of Rationalisme\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20260701122100\" /></a></span></span><br /><span class=\"talent-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\">Light of Rationalisme</a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\"><img alt=\"Light of Rationalisme\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260701122100\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_of_Rationalisme\" title=\"Light of Rationalisme\">Light of Rationalisme</a></span></span><hr /><small><span class=\"item character\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\"><img alt=\"Sandrone\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sandrone Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Sandrone_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c8/Sandrone_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260701024112\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\"><img alt=\"Sandrone\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sandrone Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Sandrone_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c8/Sandrone_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260701024112\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></span></span></small></td><td>Sandrone will enter the Radiance: Stellar Conduct state when she is inside a <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When Stellar-Conduct is triggered, the surounding area will transform into a Polestar Field for a short period of time, and when inside a Polestar Field, certain characters will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state, when grants various skill buffs.</span></span></span>, or the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s after a nearby party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction.<br />When a party member triggers a <a href=\"/wiki/Superconduct\" title=\"Superconduct\">Superconduct</a> or Cryo <a href=\"/wiki/Swirl\" title=\"Swirl\">Swirl</a> reaction, it becomes a <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct\">Stellar-Conduct</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl\" title=\"Stellar Swirl\">Stellar Swirl</a> reaction instead, and the Base DMG of the aforementioned reaction is also increased by 0.7% for every 100 points of Sandrone's ATK. A maximum increase of 14% can be obtained in this way.</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"talent\"><span class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"talent-image\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splendid_Prelude\" title=\"Splendid Prelude\"><img alt=\"Splendid Prelude\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Splendid Prelude.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Splendid_Prelude.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b0/Talent_Splendid_Prelude.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20260928031042\" /></a></span></span><br /><span class=\"talent-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splendid_Prelude\" title=\"Splendid Prelude\">Splendid Prelude</a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splendid_Prelude\" title=\"Splendid Prelude\"><img alt=\"Splendid Prelude\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Splendid Prelude.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Splendid_Prelude.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b0/Talent_Splendid_Prelude.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260928031042\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Splendid_Prelude\" title=\"Splendid Prelude\">Splendid Prelude</a></span></span><hr /><small><span class=\"item character\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\"><img alt=\"Vesna\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vesna Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Vesna_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Vesna_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260923061138\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\"><img alt=\"Vesna\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Vesna Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Vesna_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Vesna_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260923061138\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></span></span></small></td><td>When party members trigger Cryo Swirl, it will be changed to a Stellar Swirl reaction, and party members' Base DMG for the Stellar Swirl will be increased based on Vesna's ATK. Every 100 ATK she has increases the Base Stellar Swirl DMG by 0.7%. The maximum DMG increase that can be gained this way is 14%.<br />After a party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction nearby, Vesna enters the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStellar_Jubilee_Passive%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Stellar Jubilee</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">星耀祝礼</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Xīngyào Zhùlǐ</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Starbright Celebration</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">星耀祝禮</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Xīngyào Zhùlǐ</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">星光の祝福</span><br /><small><i>Seikou no Shukufuku</i></small></td><td>Starlight Blessing</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">별빛</span> <span lang=\"ko\">축복</span><br /><small><i>Byeolbit Chukbok</i></small></td><td>Starlight Blessing</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Bendici<span lang=\"es\">ó</span>n fulgorestelar</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Jubil<span lang=\"fr\">é</span> stellaire</td><td>Stellar Jubilee</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Звёздное</span> <span lang=\"ru\">торжество</span><br /><small><i>Zvyozdnoye torzhestvo</i></small></td><td>Stellar Celebration</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Stellar Jubilee</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Chúc Phúc Tinh Tú</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Sternensegnung</td><td>Stellar Blessing</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Stellar Jubilee</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>B<span lang=\"pt\">ê</span>n<span lang=\"pt\">çã</span>o das Estrelas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Y<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>ld<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>z Takdisi</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Giubileo astrale</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStellar_Jubilee_Passive%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td